Use the shared markdown-source zettelkasten with a derived SQLite/FTS/vector index.

Usage:
  strap zk create --scope user --title "Note" --body "Body" --tags strap,memory
  strap zk list --scope all
  strap zk get "Note"
  strap zk search "semantic"
  strap zk backlinks "Note"
  strap zk workon "Project note"
  strap zk promote "Project note"
  strap zk search-hybrid "semantic recall"
  strap zk reindex --scope all
